  "transcript": [
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Good day! I've loaded incident IC-2001 for Uniformes Delta. Tell me calmly what happened, with times and everything, and I'll log each thing as you say it. ",
      "t_start_ms": 1826,
      "t_end_ms": 12172
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Alright, I'm wrapped up at Uniformes Delta, heading out.",
      "t_start_ms": 13465,
      "t_end_ms": 17068
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 17069,
      "t_end_ms": 17566
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "It was the online store going down this morning.",
      "t_start_ms": 17566,
      "t_end_ms": 19568
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Log the incident report for me before I forget it all.",
      "t_start_ms": 20466,
      "t_end_ms": 22972
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Well, monitoring flagged at around 5:40 in the morning that the site wasn't responding.",
      "t_start_ms": 33468,
      "t_end_ms": 37971
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 37972,
      "t_end_ms": 38469
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "When I got there, the web server was up but stuck, with the disk nearly full. I cleaned out the old logs, tuned the memory, and it came back.",
      "t_start_ms": 38469,
      "t_end_ms": 46473
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 49019,
      "t_end_ms": 50270
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The outage was flagged by monitoring at 5:40. That's the first one.",
      "t_start_ms": 50270,
      "t_end_ms": 54973
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 54976,
      "t_end_ms": 59446
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it.",
      "t_start_ms": 60869,
      "t_end_ms": 61173
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 61174,
      "t_end_ms": 61668
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I got to the server room at seven thirty.",
      "t_start_ms": 61668,
      "t_end_ms": 63772
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And at 8:45, the site was responding again.",
      "t_start_ms": 64170,
      "t_end_ms": 67372
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noted. At seven thirty, you arrived at the server room, and at eight forty-five, the site was responding again, correct? Also, I need to confirm the web server you  mentioned. Did you mean the Online store web server (production), or the Web server for testing (staging)? ",
      "t_start_ms": 70147,
      "t_end_ms": 72269
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That went down was the production web server.",
      "t_start_ms": 72269,
      "t_end_ms": 74283
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 74283,
      "t_end_ms": 74670
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And the staging one never even noticed. It stayed up all night.",
      "t_start_ms": 74670,
      "t_end_ms": 78072
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 82227,
      "t_end_ms": 83884
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 83884,
      "t_end_ms": 84096
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 84196,
      "t_end_ms": 84206
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noted. Just to confirm the timeline, we have the outage flagged at five forty, arrived at the server room at seven thirty, and the site was back up at eight forty five, correct? Also, regarding the server, did you mean the Online store web server production or the Web server for testing staging? ",
      "t_start_ms": 84206,
      "t_end_ms": 85771
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Production.",
      "t_start_ms": 85771,
      "t_end_ms": 86172
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The production one is the one that went down, staging stayed up, that's why I say it never even noticed.",
      "t_start_ms": 86670,
      "t_end_ms": 92373
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Got it. To be sure I have the timeline right: at seven thirty you arrived at the server room, and at eight forty five the site was responding again, correct? Also, regarding the service, did you mean the Online store web server production, or the Web server for testing staging? ",
      "t_start_ms": 95516,
      "t_end_ms": 111011
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Got  it.  To  be  sure  I  have  the  timeline  right:  at  seven  thirty  you  arrived  at  the  server  room,  and  at  eight  forty  five  the  site  was  responding  again,  correct?  Also,  regarding  the  service,  did  you  mean  the  Online  store  web  server  production,  or  the  Web  server  for  testing  staging? ",
      "t_start_ms": 111011,
      "t_end_ms": 112163
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 112163,
      "t_end_ms": 115758
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "That's it, production.",
      "t_start_ms": 117273,
      "t_end_ms": 118274
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 118285,
      "t_end_ms": 118598
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "And the Payments API? Yes, that one.",
      "t_start_ms": 118673,
      "t_end_ms": 121075
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 121081,
      "t_end_ms": 121572
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The Payments one.",
      "t_start_ms": 121572,
      "t_end_ms": 122580
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Put down medium, I guess, since it's working again in the end.",
      "t_start_ms": 140675,
      "t_end_ms": 144477
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "",
      "t_start_ms": 144478,
      "t_end_ms": 148460
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Noted. So, we have the arrival at seven thirty and the site back up at eight forty-five, correct? I've recorded the Online store web server production as the affected service and noted medium severity, correct? ",
      "t_start_ms": 148602,
